    "noteZh": "README 写着 This package provides the Simple Icons 16.12.0 packaged as a set of Svelte components.，章节除 Installation、Usage、Basic example、Change title、Custom styles 之外，还多出 Demo、Type Definition for Dynamic Icons in Svelte Components 和 Faster Compilations 三节，前者专门讲动态图标怎么保住类型。docs/svg 目录存图标资源，.changeset 管发版。About 的标签里 svelte / sveltejs / svg-icons / ui-components 都挂着，Used by 210、89 star，最新 v7.2.0。",
